    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>In Twilight Town: A Cyperpunk FPS, you can play as either Ikuro or the Girl as you follow a funny yet engrossing storyline about giving Ikuro's AI wife, known as Sei, a real body in this first person shooter game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477140/extras/41aa30bc8e787b306012385a9b22d212.poster.avif?t=1751151830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477140/extras/41aa30bc8e787b306012385a9b22d212.webm?t=1751151830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477140/extras/41aa30bc8e787b306012385a9b22d212.mp4?t=1751151830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Advanced gore system</strong>: Realistic blood textures and enemy limbs will keep you engaged in the combat, the enemy limbs will always land randomly to ensure no 2 kills feel quite the same<br><br><strong>Engaging, varied combat</strong>: Get up close and personal with a shotgun, shred them with a submachine gun, pick them off with a carbine or blow them to bits with explosives, coupled with a unique headshot system, boss fights and enemy variety, the combat will always manage to stay fresh to the end<br><br><strong>Stop Time &amp; Parry</strong>: Use the game's unique parry mechanic to deflect enemy attacks back at them, furthermore, you can also stop time and unleash hell upon your foes",
    "about_the_game": "In Twilight Town: A Cyperpunk FPS, you can play as either Ikuro or the Girl as you follow a funny yet engrossing storyline about giving Ikuro's AI wife, known as Sei, a real body in this first person shooter game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477140/extras/41aa30bc8e787b306012385a9b22d212.poster.avif?t=1751151830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477140/extras/41aa30bc8e787b306012385a9b22d212.webm?t=1751151830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477140/extras/41aa30bc8e787b306012385a9b22d212.mp4?t=1751151830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Advanced gore system</strong>: Realistic blood textures and enemy limbs will keep you engaged in the combat, the enemy limbs will always land randomly to ensure no 2 kills feel quite the same<br><br><strong>Engaging, varied combat</strong>: Get up close and personal with a shotgun, shred them with a submachine gun, pick them off with a carbine or blow them to bits with explosives, coupled with a unique headshot system, boss fights and enemy variety, the combat will always manage to stay fresh to the end<br><br><strong>Stop Time &amp; Parry</strong>: Use the game's unique parry mechanic to deflect enemy attacks back at them, furthermore, you can also stop time and unleash hell upon your foes",
